{"hero_005":{"name":"Npc_005","binary":true,"skin":"normal","job":2,"element":1,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at005_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara005_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara005_0_p.webp","dialogue":"我是侍者茜塔，接下来请让我为你工作吧。\n姑且问一句，这份工需要经常加班吗？我只想每天准时下班……","imgPos":{"x":10,"y":-147}},"hero_012":{"name":"Npc_012","binary":true,"skin":"normal","job":4,"element":2,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at012_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara012_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara012_0_p.webp","dialogue":"我是荒野猎手沃夫加。我的箭矢将会为你射穿一切敌人。\n很高兴今后能为你服务。","imgPos":{"x":53,"y":-252}},"hero_014":{"name":"Npc_014","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":5,"element":3,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at014_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara014_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara014_0_p.webp","dialogue":"巴诺姆村自卫团副团长，皮塔！从今往后，我的利刃供你差遣。\n可别让它们变钝啦，老大！","imgPos":{"x":24.5,"y":-10}},"new_hero_002":{"name":"Npc_002_1","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":5,"element":2,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at002_1.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara002_1.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara002_1_p.webp","dialogue":"自我介绍？有这个必要吗？唔～我就是你最好的伙伴，米托拉！\n快快，接下来要去哪里冒险呢！","imgPos":{"x":-31,"y":-193}},"hero_023":{"name":"Npc_023","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":1,"element":3,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at023_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara023_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara023_0_p.webp","dialogue":"索利德之牙，卡夫，从巴诺姆村前来报到！\n有什么东西要让我砸碎吗，老大！","imgPos":{"x":12,"y":33}},"hero_011":{"name":"Npc_011","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":3,"element":2,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at011_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara011_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara011_0_p.webp","dialogue":"我是旧日修行所的秘术师缇莎，日后请多指教！\n啊，可以带缇莎一起回去吗……缇莎有点害怕迷路，哈哈……","imgPos":{"x":-17,"y":-153}},"hero_009":{"name":"Npc_009","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":3,"element":3,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at009_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara009_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara009_0_p.webp","dialogue":"妖精舞团的舞娘……可、可可娜。我、我可以回去了吗……","imgPos":{"x":115,"y":-20}},"hero_008":{"name":"Npc_008","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":3,"element":2,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at008_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara008_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara008_0_p.webp","dialogue":"来自图兰顿的沙炎舞娘，夏库塔拉！\n跟上咱的舞步，把气氛烧到极致吧！","imgPos":{"x":-9,"y":-23}},"hero_031":{"name":"Npc_031","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":4,"element":3,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at031_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara031_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara031_0_p.webp","dialogue":"克里斯汀的波特温爵士。现在姑且算是一名……契约者。\n就让我们在保持距离的前提下好好合作吧，“异端”。","imgPos":{"x":0,"y":-261}},"hero_007":{"name":"Npc_007","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":6,"element":3,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at007_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara007_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara007_0_p.webp","dialogue":"啊啦，我是妖精舞团的创始人，拉碧丝。\n要来做我们舞团的荣誉制作人吗？呵……还请不要拒绝呢。","imgPos":{"x":-14,"y":-122}},"hero_062":{"name":"Npc_062","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":1,"element":4,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at062_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara062_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara062_0_p.webp","dialogue":"大根子中的大根子，露比特的说！如果肚子饿了可以来找露比特，\n露比特会给你烧一手好菜的说！","imgPos":{"x":-36,"y":-74}},"hero_041":{"name":"Npc_041","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":1,"element":1,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at041_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara041_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara041_0_p.webp","dialogue":"你好，我是埃迪蒂。请下命令吧，我会为你斩断一切秩序之敌。","imgPos":{"x":-22,"y":-205}},"hero_015":{"name":"Npc_015","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":6,"element":3,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at015_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara015_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara015_0_p.webp","dialogue":"我是芭杜尔。我将与你同行，治愈所有伤口，击败一切敌人。","imgPos":{"x":-103,"y":-160}},"hero_033":{"name":"Npc_033","binary":true,"skin":"normal","job":2,"element":1,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at033_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara033_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara033_0_p.webp","dialogue":"你好呀！我是乌帕！接下来要去哪里冒险？我一定会拼尽全力战斗！\n为了变得更强，来和我一起锻炼吧！先绕这营地跑一百圈！","imgPos":{"x":-19,"y":-109}},"hero_037":{"name":"Npc_037","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":2,"element":3,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at037_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara037_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara037_0_p.webp","dialogue":"小友与吾确实有缘。呵呵，今后若是有暇，不如一起修行吧。","imgPos":{"x":24,"y":-254}},"hero_029":{"name":"Npc_029","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":6,"element":4,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at029_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara029_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara029_0_p.webp","dialogue":"大书院的灾害学者，安娜。\n有什么问题都可以请教我，我会耐心替你解答。","imgPos":{"x":27,"y":-158}},"hero_036":{"name":"Npc_036","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":3,"element":1,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at036_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara036_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara036_0_p.webp","dialogue":"我是魔爪湖的水占师，贝尔卡！\n虽然还不够成熟，但我会继续努力的！请好好看着我吧！","imgPos":{"x":48,"y":-137}},"hero_026":{"name":"Npc_026","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":1,"element":2,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at026_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara026_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara026_0_p.webp","dialogue":"本小姐就是希斯珀利亚家的贵族，赤血剑姬，贝拉多娜！\n忠诚的下仆唷，今后就请好好服侍本小姐吧！","imgPos":{"x":-14,"y":-111}},"hero_045":{"name":"Npc_045","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":3,"element":3,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at045_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara045_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara045_0_p.webp","dialogue":"你好……我叫艾尔菲帕。从今天开始我们一起战斗吧。","imgPos":{"x":-6,"y":-73}},"hero_027":{"name":"Npc_027","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":4,"element":3,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at027_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara027_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara027_0_p.webp","dialogue":"你好，我是驿站侍者队领班，梅莉莉。\n请把所有的工作都交给我吧，我会好好照顾你的！","imgPos":{"x":69,"y":-57}},"hero_025":{"name":"Npc_025","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":4,"element":4,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at025_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara025_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara025_0_p.webp","dialogue":"你好，我是来自黑森林的嘉莉缇！\n今后我们将会一起战斗，请多指教哦～","imgPos":{"x":-7,"y":-138}},"hero_066":{"name":"Npc_066","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":1,"element":1,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at066_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara066_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara066_0_p.webp","dialogue":"雪域探险家奥格，就是我啦！有什么地方想探索的尽管告诉我，\n咱们一起把那儿挖个底朝天吧！呀哈哈！","imgPos":{"x":17,"y":-66}},"hero_034":{"name":"Npc_034","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":3,"element":1,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at034_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara034_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara034_0_p.webp","dialogue":"呼啊……我是露帕……\n请问这里有可以睡觉的地方吗？我想先休息一下……","imgPos":{"x":-6,"y":-146}},"hero_046":{"name":"Npc_046","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":2,"element":4,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at046_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara046_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara046_0_p.webp","dialogue":"你……你好……我是迈妮娅。\n有什么需要尽管来找我，我什么都会做的！","imgPos":{"x":17,"y":-66}},"hero_019":{"name":"Npc_019","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":3,"element":2,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at019_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara019_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara019_0_p.webp","dialogue":"你、你好，我是奇瓦，这是我的伙伴软软，请多关照。\n不用担心，软软它不咬人的——唉？！等等，那个可不能吃呀！","imgPos":{"x":-48,"y":-187}},"hero_051":{"name":"Npc_051","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":6,"element":1,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at051_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara051_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara051_0_p.webp","dialogue":"我是阿莱克西娅，水占师之环的圣女。\n作为伙伴，今后要受您照顾了。","imgPos":{"x":69,"y":36}},"hero_049":{"name":"Npc_049","binary":true,"skin":"skill2_off","job":4,"element":4,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at049_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara049_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara049_0_p.webp","dialogue":"驿站驻索利德山特派专员菲莉娜，和你一样，也是契约者哦！","imgPos":{"x":-126,"y":-227}},"hero_050":{"name":"Npc_050","binary":true,"skin":"normal","job":1,"element":4,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at050_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara050_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara050_0_p.webp","dialogue":"索利德山自卫团的大姐头，米拉贝尔！我不在乎什么契约，\n但既然你找到了我，从今往后咱们就是一家人了！","imgPos":{"x":14,"y":-25}},"hero_055":{"name":"Npc_055","binary":true,"skin":"normal","job":1,"element":3,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at055_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara055_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara055_0_p.webp","dialogue":"我是驿站的契约者迦南，姑且算是有些名气。\n既然成为了伙伴，就让我们好好相处吧！","imgPos":{"x":57,"y":-176}},"hero_053":{"name":"Npc_053","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":5,"element":3,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at053_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara053_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara053_0_p.webp","dialogue":"我……我就是艾薇杜尔。职业是……先知！\n虽、虽然只是见习……请……今后请多关照！谢谢！","imgPos":{"x":-75,"y":118}},"hero_065":{"name":"Npc_065","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":4,"element":2,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at065_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara065_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara065_0_p.webp","dialogue":"我是乌尔勒，深渊最高等学府，大书院的院长。\n嗯……你们是奇瓦的朋友吧？今后也请多照顾我家女儿唷。","imgPos":{"x":-19,"y":41}},"hero_043":{"name":"Npc_043","binary":true,"skin":"default","job":6,"element":4,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at043_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara043_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara043_0_p.webp","dialogue":"嘿嘿……我是制药大师阿娜洛洁，也是个旅行商人！\n今后我们就是合伙人啦，还请多多指教哦！","imgPos":{"x":20,"y":-121}},"hero_064":{"name":"Npc_064","binary":true,"skin":"fire","job":5,"element":2,"idle":"idle_front","card":"/images/HeroGachaShowPanel_Atlas/gacha_at064_0.webp","portrait":"/images/chara/l/chara064_0.webp","fragment":"/images/HeroInfoPanel_Atlas/chara064_0_p.webp","dialogue":"这下我们就是永不分离的同伴啦！我是伽拉忒亚，先来握个手吧～！","imgPos":{"x":-119,"y":-115}},"pet_006":{"name":"提灯妖精","egg":"/images/eggs/pet_006.webp"},"pet_016":{"name":"吵吵蕈","egg":"/images/eggs/pet_016.webp"},"pet_017":{"name":"臭臭蕈","egg":"/images/eggs/pet_017.webp"},"pet_007":{"name":"角布林","egg":"/images/eggs/pet_007.webp"},"pet_037":{"name":"掘地芙洛波","egg":"/images/eggs/pet_037.webp"},"pet_038":{"name":"扬沙芙洛波","egg":"/images/eggs/pet_038.webp"},"pet_043":{"name":"顽劣灯火","egg":"/images/eggs/pet_043.webp"},"pet_044":{"name":"游离灯火","egg":"/images/eggs/pet_044.webp"},"pet_062":{"name":"射水杜吉芽","egg":"/images/eggs/pet_062.webp"},"pet_045":{"na